:49:40Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- Fix Codex workspace launching and network requirements handling, and preserve approval reviewer settings.\n- Protect configuration saves against stale concurrent edits and preserve provider capabilities, routing rules, and fallback settings.\n- Bundle the gateway regression fixes in every release: valid Anthropic tool IDs and replay histories, complete Fusion traces, and accurate upstream HTTP status and headers.\n- Improve fallback error details, Anthropic reasoning compatibility, OpenCode Go cache usage, and live OAuth credential refresh during model discovery and requests.\n- Keep tool results paired during Claude Code context compaction and improve Windows launcher argument escaping.\n- Support public OpenCode Zen free-tier imports and Serply Fusion web search.\n- Improve request log recovery and activity heatmap sizing in the main window and tray.\n- Update both English and Chinese README download links to v3.1.2.\n\n## What's Changed\n* docs: add international Kimi Code link (kimi.ai/code) to README and README_zh by @ysntony in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1812\n* fix: resolve 403 FreeTierError on public OpenCode Zen providers by @diogomcd in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1827\n* fix(context-archive): keep trailing tool_result when replacing Claude Code compact prompt by @pomelogo in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1824\n* feat(fusion): add Serply as a web search provider by @googio in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1821\n* fix(ui): reserve the month label row's real height in activity grids by @Burlesque1 in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1820\n\n## New Contributors\n* @ysntony made their first contribution in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1812\n* @pomelogo made their first contribution in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1824\n* @googio made their first contribution in https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/pull/1821\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/compare/v3.1.1...v3.1.2","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5}
